ub – A dedicated rooftop featuring pool, jacuzzi, sauna, ice bath, cinema, and social spaces.</li><li>Well-Planned Residences – 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments with maid’s rooms, designed with functional layouts and generous balconies.</li><li>Generous Ceiling Heights – Living spaces reaching up to 2.8m and elevated lounge areas enhancing openness and natural light.</li><li>Established Developer Legacy – Delivered by Al Ghurair Development, part of a diversified group with decades of regional expertise.</li><li>Flexible 60/40 Structure – Balanced installment plan designed to align payments with construction milestones.</li><li>10% Down Payment Advantage – Secure your home with a competitive initial commitment in a high-growth district.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2082,"cta":{"id":2920,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/location_49380c6e5a.jpg","hash":"location_49380c6e5a","name":"location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Connected Living In The Heart Of JVC","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>The Weave apartments are located in Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC), offering convenient access to Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road (E311) and Al Khail Road (E44). This strategic positioning ensures effortless connectivity to Dubai’s business districts, retail hubs, and leisure destinations while maintaining a neighborhood-focused lifestyle.</p><ul><li>3 Minutes – Circle Mall</li><li>5 Minutes – Dubai Sports City</li><li>5 Minutes – Motor City</li><li>10 Minutes – Dubai Miracle Garden</li><li>18 Minutes – Mall of the Emirates</li><li>23 Minutes – Business Bay</li><li>25 Minutes – Downtown Dubai</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":4932,"url":null,"file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west